        desc = "D56 line buffer This word is the SAO LEFT buffer: size 21B (B = ALIGN128(H maximum)); always allocated. PROVEN. Provenance: PROVEN (word offset). Source: HEVCHAL_V400R004_SetPicMsg / SetSliceMsg (GPL Kirin source); shift constants and stored word offsets of HEVCHAL_V400R001_SetPicMsg / SetSliceMsg (hi3536dv100_vfmw.ko) agree.";
