        desc = "D60 PPS flags Provenance: PROVEN (shift constants). Source: HEVCHAL_V400R004_SetPicMsg / SetSliceMsg (GPL Kirin source); shift constants and stored word offsets of HEVCHAL_V400R001_SetPicMsg / SetSliceMsg (hi3536dv100_vfmw.ko) agree.";
