        name = "D8 list1[0] PMV address";
        desc = "D8-D9 (B slices only): PMV address of list1[0] & ~0xF; D9 the same + half_pmvblk_offset for field pairs else 0 (INFERRED). Provenance: PROVEN position, INFERRED meaning. Source: hi3536dv100_vfmw.ko H264HAL_V400R001_SetPicMsg (0x2ac04) / SetSliceMsg (0x2ae80), word-checked statically and by a differential run of the vendor code in qemu-arm user mode on 2026-11-22 (what the code programs, not what silicon answers); names and shift constants agree with R004 vdm_hal_h264.c (GPL Kirin source), docs/research/vdh-hi3536d-static-analysis-2026-11-22.md.";
